OL,3,GNEWSADementia patient's deportation
OL,4,Adelayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with dementia will be able to
OL,7,Fremain in Sweden while a legal bid to
OL,8,Fdelay his deportation is considered.
OL,10,FThe Swedish authorities said they
OL,11,Fwanted George Mason, originally from
OL,12,FHinckley in Leicestershire, to leave
OL,13,Fthe country by midnight on 20 August,
OL,14,Fafter his application for permanent
OL,15,Fresidency was rejected.
OL,17,FMason's daughter, Michelle Torossian,
OL,18,Fsaid the family had been told an
OL,19,Finjunction to halt his deportation
OL,20,Fwould be decided by Swedish authorities
OL,21,Fin a timeframe of two weeks to six
OL,22,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
