OL,3,GNEWSADementia patient's deportation
OL,4,Adelayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTorossian said she was told by the
OL,7,FBritish Embassy in Stockholm that the
OL,8,Foriginal deportation decision would not
OL,9,Fbe enforced by the authorities while
OL,10,Fthe injunction order was considered.
